      "imageWidth": 2536,
      "imageHeight": 3754,
      "story": "The Mocking of Christ is an early oil on wood painting (1503–1505) by Matthias Grünewald. It is located today in the Alte Pinakothek, Munich.",
      "facts": [
        "A torturer who pulls on the rope stands before him, with his back turned to the viewer.",
